e8xjyo" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="efa6efc9-6ba4-4f84-9dd4-003e5625c12d" class="r-ejplpk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>OUR COMMITMENT</p></span></div><picture data-rid="79151a4c-0b33-4bfa-90f4-097f13e5b9d9" class="r-aw6w2b"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/2ee6ec90-baee-4f21-b088-c47798c979a2/51909340-f6f0-4de5-92ab-faa2dd288835?width=32" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/2ee6ec90-baee-4f21-b088-c47798c979a2/51909340-f6f0-4de5-92ab-faa2dd288835?width=32" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/2ee6ec90-baee-4f21-b088-c47798c979a2/51909340-f6f0-4de5-92ab-faa2dd288835?width=32" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/2ee6ec90-baee-4f21-b088-c47798c979a2/51909340-f6f0-4de5-92ab-faa2dd288835" class="r-1hvqwhn" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div data-rid="6206a1cc-5371-4c96-ae36-4106a0109bb5" class="r-1gqlao2"><div data-rid="ef221112-f7d6-48bc-92b2-ca7247e0691b" data-custom="font-weight" class="r-1n5sq39 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>Yumwoof is the <strong>first dog food brand</strong> testing heavy metals.</h2></span></div><div data-rid="c532e9a4-9380-4ff9-bd0f-93e6a6dbe569" data-custom="font-weight" class="r-13ur6j6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yumwoof is the </p><p><strong>first dog food brand</strong> testing heavy metals.</p></span></div><div data-rid="ad489cd6-0ce5-4c00-87f5-a555f24de3d3" class="r-1fk73ln"></div></div><div data-rid="50fc981e-18d7-4fe9-9bc1-7c3d40d46a31" class="r-i3povv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Arsenic, lead, cadmium & mercury are now widespread in pet food. Law doesn't require brands to to test, but we do it anyway through an independent, accredited lab.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="d98fa1bd-c73d-4612-b1f3-59667cca4f28" class="r-q67xsm" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e564e580-8294-4c43-8d85-22c0f85345be" class="r-ahay2a" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="4a46200f-63ac-4185-b34f-5bbaa27a1cdd" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="replo-:R1lj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-yh7e2y r-3bcsuz"><div data-rid="c4373367-a3b5-40c5-bc37-3ff718b83a62" class="r-y5w8lh"><div data-rid="95f427e5-9870-45c4-8d8f-83056d6b741b" class="r-15w1ix3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Heavy Metals</p></span></div><div data-rid="701b12ba-319b-462c-bf78-8e235affd70e" class="r-1xm5ybc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Industry-Leading Standards</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="feb28deb-7251-4bbb-a61d-d870a88553b3" class="r-tkmsbd" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-up" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:R1lj2:"><div data-rid="a45d881f-a561-4539-aacd-a3485aad9323" class="r-1e8c9hq"><div data-rid="482c94ae-4ace-4a1f-ad11-e93561ae914e" class="r-ih2jgl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Independent lab results of Yumwoof Perfect Superfood show 50–100x lower heavy metals than EU and US safety thresholds.</strong></p></span></div><div data-rid="8dbd5585-a136-43dd-a5d3-2454ba56818e" class="r-18m220c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Heavy metals can enter pet food through soil, water, and raw ingredients. While trace amounts are often unavoidable, we test through an independent, accredited lab. Our goal is simple: full transparency and levels that align with FDA guidelines and EU standards.</p></span></div><div class="r-176i91n" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="82824f82-2d0e-490c-a496-49a92e47ba5c" class="r-kyxvgv"><div data-rid="f81e7a2a-65bf-4f09-a91d-297966dcd02c" class="r-1ssz69s"><div data-rid="b91ff88a-9aec-4188-b7c9-4da438919c57" class="r-if7bcm alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Arsenic</p></span></div><div data-rid="7524d584-0b05-4493-8334-4a835096ad08" class="r-1prh3x8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Tested</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="d210ef1e-9520-42a1-aa0a-d9f90f254edd" class="r-zejznw"><div data-rid="5e667203-1101-49e2-82a1-47c23761ba6d" class="r-5pxhw6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Lead</p></span></div><div data-rid="13a9508b-bc8d-418c-90b9-1f8499a410cc" class="r-vjf1pk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Tested</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="b9e42449-ee2f-46c2-a453-d299fbec3cee" class="r-lvefjr"><div data-rid="fb7cf08a-59dc-4c99-bf2c-16ee51c11382" class="r-xyh8d alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Cadmium</p></span></div><div data-rid="e7b7b7e1-4222-4faf-85a9-e3e6c59870b5" class="r-1od6c14 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Tested</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="a4c8de18-10e1-40d8-bd76-256cd3fa429e" class="r-kr39tu"><div data-rid="2ea44577-c699-4d01-acfb-be098e45e94d" class="r-mjaxcs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Mercury</p></span></div><div data-rid="18977756-69af-4eeb-9b51-f8116e3c9576" class="r-1jecrk7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Tested</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="e38c8103-01f3-4210-be1d-fe1c9f32b0a8" class="r-1jbo9ee"></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="822d36c2-64bd-4a6b-b5ea-33e0b5439ffa" class="r-83qajr" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0d055d98-b78f-4801-bff5-a0782f18b627" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2lj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-sxi81p"><div data-rid="ec5c14fa-f57f-4885-a6f3-fa193bf5c5a8" class="r-lonc51"><div data-rid="1379e0ab-a162-43b2-a209-7e49c10470ba" class="r-g5buh5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Seed Oils & Inflammatory Fats</p></span></div><div data-rid="064acce8-c8b3-449e-8366-ffc633c8873e" class="r-1gilpjt alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>None</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="60146f7a-a256-4edc-8c6d-4915dfc46f64" class="r-1ijhqmq" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2lj2:"><div data-rid="ee1deb27-7a0f-48d2-aa7f-33961dea04f4" class="r-17gfyyi"><div data-rid="afca1138-8a7a-4fa1-be7b-c2a2412762d0" class="r-1accuz6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Many conventional kibbles rely on highly processed seed oils as a cheap fat source. We don’t. Instead, we use nutrient-rich super fats like coconut to provide energy without unnecessary inflammatory oils that can disrupt digestive balance.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b6613e72-b15b-4bff-a7a6-ba537c77f99a" class="r-rao48z" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="619ef9ee-72c8-4a2d-9fc0-1ccd7c0e98e9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3lj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1phrc5m"><div data-rid="581db932-ffd7-4ba5-8c45-0a042a19ce02" class="r-1v2jlry"><div data-rid="5f6e1713-226f-492b-969a-839af9c6ed1a" class="r-mtimws alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Synthetic Vitamins</p></span></div><div data-rid="716ea814-30be-46cd-acc1-f3ff2210340a" class="r-zjbah7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>None</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="cd69e78d-666e-4544-ba2a-40ecb2a1eeec" class="r-29bagu" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3lj2:"><div data-rid="d856a27c-2fc9-4df3-be46-19cf70328f99" class="r-1e2tvpq"><div data-rid="24c2057e-d650-4cfe-9388-d524c63aff4d" class="r-1n75but alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Extruded kibble destroys nutrients through high heat, then relies on synthetic vitamins to add back what was lost. Our gentle air-drying process preserves the naturally occurring nutrients found in whole food ingredients — real meats, organ meats, and other minimally processed foods your dog's body is designed to absorb.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5cdd1bda-d017-451b-8e35-d70d9be38248" class="r-6x8zw" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e43160eb-6697-4015-bec6-0c853675f42d" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R4lj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-x40rkg"><div data-rid="62d1c765-9dbc-489c-b304-4facfd38d935" class="r-329zw4"><div data-rid="a71de291-2612-469a-adb3-ca4d2dd8edc1" class="r-1rc6jzo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>By-Products & Rendered Meals</p></span></div><div data-rid="c92b3661-a905-450a-a89c-8e433f983b26" class="r-10noqwu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>None</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="59eeef5e-77c7-4dbf-967e-686164b90369" class="r-6w6dr7" aria-hidden="true"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R4lj2:"><div data-rid="9a768bbd-d2e9-46d6-be1a-c882fdd68b78" class="r-1qxle52"><div data-rid="4113fa27-b205-445b-b017-36c57bde9ee4" class="r-16azoxf alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Rendered meals and by-products can vary in quality and are often heavily processed. We use real, recognizable ingredients instead, so you know exactly what’s going into your dog’s bowl.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4644c964-2223-4799-8258-23daed456d41" class="r-m85349"><div class="r-12twqeo" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="1e4ef1f6-4ba2-4308-93e0-0f8a35a74e8b" class="r-2a69ow"><div data-rid="9d10fc3e-2f8b-493e-9c85-cb1e50c9b513" class="r-hpcjzn"><div data-rid="439ab5bc-e83c-43a8-9cd4-64b3c9a2a514" class="r-19clxvs alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>WHY IT MATTERS</p></span></div><div data-rid="37748982-1cc5-4f5e-9f8f-288bf4938804" class="r-ugne94 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>Your Dog Eats The Same Food Every Day. Is Yours Tested?</h2></span></div><div data-rid="a46ccd7c-8391-4e2d-8dd2-01e648269d8e" class="r-pi4vo0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most dogs lack variety, eating the same food for years. When a brand takes shortcuts—including heavy metals—it compounds over time putting our dog at risk. Yumwoof strives to give your dog the cleanest ingredients you can trust.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="b7d9bc4d-27b1-456e-a0d7-830fd278c5c1" class="r-1lr4f8o"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/2ee6ec90-baee-4f21-b088-c47798c979a2/74fdd0d3-adb5-4dec-a2b3-23d13c6e2670?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/2ee6ec90-baee-4f21-b088-c47798c979a2/74fdd0d3-adb5-4dec-a2b3-23d13c6e2670?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641p